{"lines": [{"t": 2157.32, "text": "Fernandez, wide to Tagliafico.", "voice": "pbp", "sal": 2, "cuts": false, "file": "da806cd3b542.wav", "dur": 1.72, "n": 4, "names": ["Tagliafico", "Fernandez"]}, {"t": 2160.66, "text": "Fernandez.", "voice": "pbp", "sal": 2, "cuts": false, "file": "89044fbc36b2.wav", "dur": 0.88, "n": 1, "names": ["Fernandez"]}, {"t": 2163.76, "text": "Tagliafico.", "voice": "pbp", "sal": 2, "cuts": false, "file": "9aa02977d847.wav", "dur": 0.88, "n": 1, "names": ["Tagliafico"]}, {"t": 2166.64, "text": "Di María, wide on the left.", "voice": "pbp", "sal": 2, "cuts": false, "file": "5ab8a71ca30a.wav", "dur": 2.28, "n": 6, "names": ["Di María"]}, {"t": 2169.16, "text": "Di María, back to Fernandez.", "voice": "pbp", "sal": 2, "cuts": false, "file": "462d89a43341.wav", "dur": 2.0, "n": 5, "names": ["Di María", "Fernandez"]}, {"t": 2174.38, "text": "Argentina are dominating possession. France have to stay patient.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "75e394a4f6f7.wav", "dur": 3.12, "n": 9, "names": []}, {"t": 2180.46, "text": "Martínez.", "voice": "pbp", "sal": 2, "cuts": false, "file": "42f3e76e1ccf.wav", "dur": 0.88, "n": 1, "names": ["Martínez"]}, {"t": 2191.41, "text": "Molina.", "voice": "pbp", "sal": 2, "cuts": false, "file": "44d2863c4b88.wav", "dur": 0.88, "n": 1, "names": ["Molina"]}, {"t": 2195.97, "text": "Molina scored in the quarter-final against the Netherlands, from a Messi pass.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "f05b8f6181fd.wav", "dur": 3.96, "n": 12, "names": ["Messi", "Molina"]}, {"t": 2205.62, "text": "France keep pushing attacks down the left side; that's where it's paying off for them.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "b27789125db4.wav", "dur": 4.8, "n": 15, "names": []}, {"t": 2212.24, "text": "Argentina break! Álvarez leads it.", "voice": "pbp", "sal": 6, "cuts": false, "file": "a4dad0989b71.wav", "dur": 2.0, "n": 5, "names": ["Álvarez"]}, {"t": 2215.96, "text": "Di María free on the far side!", "voice": "pbp", "sal": 6, "cuts": false, "file": "035cf43260ed.wav", "dur": 2.56, "n": 7, "names": ["Di María"]}, {"t": 2217.65, "text": "GOAL! Ángel Di María scores for Argentina, set up by Alexis MacAllister! Argentina 2-0 France.", "voice": "pbp", "sal": 10, "cuts": true, "file": "96ed567313ec.wav", "dur": 4.8, "n": 15, "names": ["Di María", "MacAllister"]}, {"t": 2223.11, "text": "Di María with a clinical finish. And what a precise ball from MacAllister.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "d9bc112dfe15.wav", "dur": 4.24, "n": 13, "names": ["Di María", "MacAllister"]}, {"t": 2228.11, "text": "MacAllister started it, then Messi and Álvarez carried it on.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "e1d442e5b539.wav", "dur": 3.4, "n": 10, "names": ["Messi", "MacAllister", "Álvarez"]}, {"t": 2232.11, "text": "Wow, huge space for Di María out wide. No one marked him at all.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "34ef0b3c3cfc.wav", "dur": 4.52, "n": 14, "names": ["Di María"]}, {"t": 2237.11, "text": "Di María missed the 2014 final through injury.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "c15754c32c41.wav", "dur": 2.84, "n": 8, "names": ["Di María"]}, {"t": 2240.61, "text": "Argentina really have this final under control now.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "9f283188faf3.wav", "dur": 2.84, "n": 8, "names": []}, {"t": 2253.11, "text": "35 minutes played, Argentina 2-0 France.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "e3113cbeef52.wav", "dur": 2.28, "n": 6, "names": []}, {"t": 2256.11, "text": "Deschamps has a big half-time talk to give.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "f049ae54892a.wav", "dur": 2.84, "n": 8, "names": []}, {"t": 2268.61, "text": "Argentina can't afford to switch off; that one goal changes everything in a final.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "cac07402e7db.wav", "dur": 4.52, "n": 14, "names": []}, {"t": 2273.61, "text": "Most of the shots are from inside the box—these are real chances being created.", "voice": "analyst", "sal": 1, "cuts": false, "file": "82bd156fc920.wav", "dur": 4.52, "n": 14, "names": []}], "human": [[2153.16, 1, "Messi"], [2154.6, 0, null], [2155.08, 0, null], [2155.24, 0, null], [2155.4, 1, "Koundé"], [2159.68, 0, null], [2159.92, 1, "Fernandez"], [2161.64, 0, null], [2161.92, 0, null], [2162.12, 0, null], [2162.28, 0, null], [2162.4, 0, null], [2163.36, 0, null], [2163.8, 0, null], [2164.12, 0, null], [2164.2, 0, null], [2164.4, 0, null], [2164.8, 0, null], [2164.92, 0, null], [2169.44, 0, null], [2170.2, 0, null], [2170.4, 0, null], [2171.88, 0, null], [2172.48, 0, null], [2172.68, 0, null], [2172.84, 0, null], [2173.16, 0, null], [2173.28, 0, null], [2173.52, 0, null], [2196.6, 0, null], [2196.92, 0, null], [2197.36, 1, "Romero"], [2197.96, 0, null], [2198.16, 0, null], [2198.6, 1, "Mbappé"], [2199.32, 0, null], [2199.64, 0, null], [2199.84, 1, "Romero"], [2200.36, 0, null], [2200.8, 0, null], [2201.08, 1, "Fernandez"], [2201.64, 0, null], [2202.8, 0, null], [2202.88, 0, null], [2203.2, 0, null], [2203.44, 0, null], [2203.48, 0, null], [2203.56, 0, null], [2203.84, 0, null], [2203.96, 0, null], [2207.08, 0, null], [2207.32, 0, null], [2207.4, 0, null], [2207.76, 0, null], [2207.92, 0, null], [2208.12, 0, null], [2208.28, 0, null], [2208.6, 0, null], [2208.68, 0, null], [2209.0, 0, null], [2209.16, 0, null], [2210.32, 1, "Messi"], [2210.96, 0, null], [2211.16, 0, null], [2212.12, 0, null], [2213.0, 1, "Álvarez"], [2213.88, 0, null], [2214.12, 1, "MacAllister"], [2215.08, 0, null], [2215.28, 1, "Di María"], [2215.72, 0, null], [2215.88, 0, null], [2216.0, 0, null], [2216.36, 0, null], [2217.0, 0, null], [2217.2, 0, null], [2217.44, 0, null], [2217.68, 1, "Di María"], [2218.76, 0, null], [2219.44, 0, null], [2223.64, 0, null], [2224.8, 0, null], [2225.72, 0, null], [2230.6, 0, null], [2230.88, 0, null], [2231.04, 0, null],